cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RouteGuard-LLM in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "RouteGuard-LLM: Reliability-Aware Adaptive Routing for LLM Inference"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mohebi
    given-names: Mirwais
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-19
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - large language models
  - model routing
  - uncertainty estimation
  - calibration
  - selective prediction
  - multilingual evaluation
  - Kazakh
  - Persian
  - Dari
abstract: >-
  RouteGuard-LLM is an open-source framework for studying adaptive, reliability-aware LLM
  inference. It routes each query to one of several models based on its estimated difficulty,
  estimates and calibrates the reliability of the answer, verifies it with deterministic checks
  where possible, and escalates unreliable answers to stronger inference strategies. It includes a
  reproducible, leakage-safe benchmark protocol with multilingual evaluation in English, Kazakh,
  Russian, Persian, and Dari.
